 Hardware-detected support package for Apple MacBook / MacBookPro systems running Fihri OS 1.0:
  1. BD PROCHOT CPU throttle fix (canlinux-bdprochot-fix.service clearing MSR 0x1fc
     bit 0 at boot so faulty battery sensors do not pin the CPU at 1.2 GHz).
  2. Display & keyboard backlight permissions (90-canlinux-backlight.rules for
     gmux_backlight and smc::kbd_backlight mode 0664 group video + user group membership)
     plus MacBook-aware canlinux-session-owner (0660 root:video instead of 0000 during RDP,
     and internal keyboard kept enabled in X11 so local Fn keys work).
