     (XF86KbdBrightnessDown/Up calling org.deepin.dde.BacklightHelper1 type 2 leds / sysfs,
     working around unwired KbdLightController in dde-session-daemon).
  4. F3 (Mission Control / XF86LaunchA -> multitasking/expose-all-windows) and
     F4 (Launchpad / XF86LaunchB -> DDE Launcher) bindings in kglobalshortcutsrc & DDE keybinding.
  5. Apple keyboard Fn mode (/etc/modprobe.d/fihri-macbook-hid-apple.conf with fnmode=1).
  6. Dual-GPU stability on Intel+NVIDIA MacBooks (/etc/X11/xorg.conf.d/20-intel-primary.conf
     when Intel i915 is at PCI:0:2:0 alongside NVIDIA, plus kwinrc blurEnabled=false
     and scissorEnabled=true to prevent nouveau GL crashes while keeping rounded corners).
  7. PipeWire audio readiness (human users in audio/video groups, lightdm greeter
     audio masked, pulseaudio masked in favor of PipeWire).
  8. Broadcom BCM4331/BCM43xx STA (wl) module activation when present.
  9. HiDPI-aware FreeRDP shadow geometry recording (/usr/local/bin/freerdp-shadow-start.sh)
     and apport crash-storm guard.
  Includes /usr/local/bin/fihri-hw-detect for Updates UI hardware gating and defensive
  postinst detection: on non-MacBook hardware, MacBook-specific tweaks safely no-op.

